	(text "Goals:\n- ESP32-S3 based\n- Support for a 12V LiFePo4 solar system in power and power measurement\n- Optional support for a 1S LiPo cell with an off-board \n- Support for an optional load cell measurement\n- Support for a micro-SD card for logging\n- Support for 8 channels of PDM microphones\n- Support for touch sensors"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
